  <div class="wf-wrap">
    <h2>Questions, Answered</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details open><summary>Is the air report really free?</summary><p>Yes. Enter your ZIP and we'll pull live air-quality data for your area and email you a personalized report. No purchase necessary, ever.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Where do the numbers come from?</summary><p>Live readings from the U.S. EPA AirNow monitoring network and public pollen and particulate data for your area, pulled the moment you check.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What do I do with the cigarette comparison?</summary><p>It's a way to make an invisible dose of fine particles feel real. It is an estimate based on published research, not a medical measurement. The point is simple: smoke days are worth taking seriously.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What is BetterLungs?</summary><p>A once-a-day mullein gummy formulated by a Doctor of Pharmacy to support easier, fuller breathing. It's a dietary supplement, not a treatment for any condition, and never a replacement for anything your doctor has you doing.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Will you text me?</summary><p>Only if you add your mobile number, and only with air-quality alerts and occasional updates you can stop anytime by replying STOP.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

